\newlabel{fig:si_ablation}{{5}{6}{System~I hyperparameter ablation. \textit {Left:} SBC KS $p$-value vs.\^^Mtraining budget for both marginals. \textit {Centre:} Sc\,2 $\beta $ posterior mean vs.\ training budget, stabilising near the true value ($0.70$) by $n_\mathrm {sim}=5{,}000$. \textit {Right:} SBC KS $p$-value across the architecture and estimator-family configurations, all at $n_\mathrm {sim}= 10{,}000$.\relax }{figure.caption.19}{}}
